{
  "summary": "This experiment tested combining ViT-L image encoding with transformer aggregation in a multimodal multiprofile setup, achieving validation accuracy of 0.7250 and F1 of 0.6847. The result suggests this combination may improve performance compared to prior configurations using ViT-L with avgpool aggregation. However, the exact contribution of transformer aggregation versus encoder complexity remains uncertain without direct comparisons to alternative aggregation methods or encoder combinations."
}

